{"availability":"available","full":"ocoda/event-sourcing","name":"event-sourcing","description":"An event-sourcing library for NestJS","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":270,"forks":16,"created":"2022-07-22T21:28:45Z","updated":"2026-10-05T23:07:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://ocoda.github.io/event-sourcing/","topics":["cqrs","ddd","dynamodb","event-sourcing","mariadb","mongodb","nestjs","postgresql"],"demo":"https://ocoda.github.io/event-sourcing/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:17.477Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:17.477Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:17.477Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:17.477Z","stars":270,"forks":16}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["@ocoda/event-sourcing is a library for NestJS with the building blocks for Domain-Driven Design (DDD), CQRS and Event Sourcing:","4.0 is released: NestJS 12, ES modules only, Node.js 22.12 or later, global positions and readAll(), typed buses and awaited publishers. Upgrading from 3.x? Follow the migration guide. 3.x is on the latest-3 tag and receives security and critical fixes until at least 2027-03-31."],"features":["Aggregates and value objects: aggregates change their state through events, and ids keep their class.","Typed command and query buses: Command and Query give execute() its result type.","An event store with optimistic concurrency, correlation and causation ids, headers, and a global position per pool that readAll() reads in order, for projections and consumers that resume from a checkpoint.","Snapshots that a snapshot repository takes at an interval, so long streams load fast.","Event publishers and subscribers: publishers are awaited, in order per stream, and every delivery failure is reported on an observable."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ocoda/event-sourcing/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7b33bfad3fd117698ef6a898229bd9f3a67513d31abf5d1f7